>> Greeter := ວັດຖຸ ໃໝ່.
Greeter ເມື່ອ: ['make'] ເຮັດ: {
	>> gr := ວັດຖຸ ໃໝ່.
	gr ເມື່ອ: ['setName:'] ເຮັດ: { :aname
		ຂອງຕົນ ຊື່ := aname.
	}.
	gr ເມື່ອ: ['greet'] ເຮັດ: {
		ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: ຂອງຕົນ ຊື່.
	}. <- gr.
}.
>> a := Greeter make.
>> b := Greeter make.
a setName: ['ONE'].
b setName: ['TWO'].
a greet.
b greet.
>> c := a ໃໝ່.
c setName: ['THREE'].
c greet.
>> d := a ໃໝ່.
d setName: ['FOUR'].
d greet.
c greet.
